<title>CHINA: SHAW BROTHERS YEAR NET DOWN 84.81 PCT.</title>
<headline>SHAW BROTHERS YEAR NET DOWN 84.81 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   74.0	  vs 489.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0	  vs 15.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  164.42 gain vs 16.50 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    295.71	vs 1,947.16</p>
<p>    Turnover		     82.57	 vs 100.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Shaw Brothers (Hong Kong) Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 16-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 9</p>
<p>NOTE - Film producer and distributor Shaw Brothers also engages in property development and investment.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on disposal of interests in an associated company.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is 20 HK cents (including interim dividend of five cents) vs 120 cents (including interim dividend and special dividend).</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
